# Group Project: cast for {1}{W} it creates a 2/2 red and white Spirit. Its flashback, "Tap three untapped creatures you control",
# is refused while Bot1 has only two untapped creatures of its own: the Spirit and one new Ornithopter, with a third Ornithopter
# tapped from attacking and Bot2's untapped Ornithopter not Bot1's to tap. It is offered with three, the two newest summoning
# sick, which does not stop tapping them as a cost. Bot1 makes a second Spirit and the card is exiled.

[Bot1 Deck]
Plains x3
Ornithopter x3
Group Project
Plains x13

[Bot2 Deck]
Ornithopter
Mountain x19

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Hand.Plains.Play
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Plains.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Group Project.Cast
[T3 Bot1.BeginCombat]
Bot1.Attack(Ornithopter > Bot2)
[T3 Bot1.Main2]
! Bot1.Graveyard.Group Project.Cast(Ability: Flashback)
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
! Bot1.Graveyard.Group Project.Cast(Ability: Flashback)
Bot1.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot1.Graveyard.Group Project.Cast(Ability: Flashback)
[T3 Bot1.End]

[Expect]
